@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = PEGAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_DE_ADMIN_AQUI
@rolId = 1

### Listar roles (solo administrador)
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles/?pagina=1&tamano_pagina=10&solo_activos=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener rol
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles/{{rolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear rol (el nombre debe ser administrador, gestion_laboratorios o docente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "docente",
  "descripcion": "Consulta de horarios y matriculas; reporta incidentes",
  "es_activo": true
}

### Actualizar rol
PUT {{baseUrl}}/roles/{{rolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descripcion": "Rol actualizado",
  "es_activo": true
}

### Eliminar rol
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/roles/{{rolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
